OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FShowers return for the
OL,6,Fmorning, but these should ease for
OL,7,Fmany through the afternoon as a ridge
OL,8,Fof high pressure moves in. Feeling
OL,9,Ffresher, with a northwesterly breeze.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,12,FStaying on the mixed side, with
OL,13,Ffurther showers and longer spells of
OL,14,Frain through this period. Some sunnier
OL,15,Fmoments in between. Temperatures
OL,16,Faround average for early
OL,17,Fmeteorological Autumn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
